abstract: "A from-scratch Mixture-of-Experts transformer trained for agentic coding tasks. Features grouped-query attention, SwiGLU activations, QK-normalisation, and a 6-stage RL pipeline (pretrain → RFT → RLVR → PRM → Agent RL). Built from PyTorch primitives with no dependence on pre-trained weights."
